
### 1. First Spring AI request
### Explain the difference between REQUIRED and REQUIRES_NEW
# @timeout 300
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "spring-interview-1",
  "message": "Explain the difference between REQUIRED and REQUIRES_NEW in Spring with a practical example."
}

