### 8. Test calculator tool
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "tool-call-test",
  "message": "Use the calculator tool to calculate simple interest on EUR 1000 at 3% per year for 6 months. Tell me the interest and total amount."
}

### 9. Test calculateSimpleInterest with exact arguments
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "calculator-test-002",
  "message": "Call the calculateSimpleInterest tool with exactly these arguments: principal = 1000.0, annualRatePercent = 3.0, months = 6. Do not change any argument. Return the calculated interest and total amount."
}

